# httpyac: routine.http의 준비 요청을 참조해 ID·서버 날짜를 자동 사용한다.
# 준비 요청 최초 실행 후, 오류 요청 자체가 DB를 바꾸지 않는지 확인한다.
# 오류 응답은 error.code와 details:null을 확인한다. 요청은 개별 실행한다.
# ADR-059~063·066의 계약 기대값이다. 비밀번호는 공백 제거 없이 검사하며 공백 포함 시 400 VALIDATION_ERROR로 거절한다.
# @import ./routine.http
@wrongPassword = 1111
@pastDate = 2026-10-01
@futureDate = 2099-01-01
@missingStudyId = ffffffff-ffff-4fff-bfff-ffffffffffff
@missingRoutineId = eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-beee-eeeeeeeeeeee
@otherStudyRoutineId = 20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000201
@endedRoutineId = 20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000206

### 01 API-AU-01 비밀번호 오답 — 401 PASSWORD_MISMATCH
# @ref routineCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/password-verifications
Content-Type: application/json

{"password":"{{wrongPassword}}"}

### 02 API-AU-01 비밀번호 누락 — 401 VERIFICATION_REQUIRED
# @ref routineCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/password-verifications
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 03 API-HB-01 진입 확인 후에도 헤더 누락 — 401 VERIFICATION_REQUIRED
# @ref routineCreate
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines

### 04 API-HB-02 헤더 누락 생성 — 401 VERIFICATION_REQUIRED
# @ref routineCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"차단 검증"}

### 05 API-HB-05 헤더 누락 체크 — 401 VERIFICATION_REQUIRED
# @ref routineCreate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines/{{routineId}}/check
Content-Type: application/json

{"recordDate":"{{todayDate}}","completed":true}

### 06 API-HB-01 비밀번호 오답 — 401 PASSWORD_MISMATCH
# @ref routineCreate
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines
X-Study-Password: {{wrongPassword}}

### 07 API-HB-02 오답 생성 — 401 PASSWORD_MISMATCH
# @ref routineCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines
X-Study-Password: {{wrongPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"차단 검증"}

### 08 API-HB-05 오답 해제 — 401 PASSWORD_MISMATCH
# @ref routineCreate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines/{{routineId}}/check
X-Study-Password: {{wrongPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"recordDate":"{{todayDate}}","completed":false}

### 09 API-HB-01 비밀번호 공백 포함 거절 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
# has space는 공백이 포함된 형식 오류다. hasspace로 보정하거나 bcrypt 오답으로 처리하지 않는다.
# @ref routineCreate
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines
X-Study-Password: has space

### 10 API-HB-01 비밀번호 3자 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
# @ref routineCreate
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines
X-Study-Password: abc

### 11 API-HB-01 비밀번호 21자 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
# @ref routineCreate
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines
X-Study-Password: aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa

### 12 API-HB-01 허용하지 않는 비밀번호 문자 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
# @ref routineCreate
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines
X-Study-Password: abc-def

