GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{studyId}}/routines?keyword=test
X-Study-Password: {{password}}

### 25 API-HB-01 없는 스터디 — 404 STUDY_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{missingStudyId}}/routines
X-Study-Password: {{password}}

### 26 API-HB-02 없는 스터디 — 404 STUDY_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{missingStudyId}}/routines
X-Study-Password: {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"독서"}

